 * Override order:
 *   --backend / --file flag > TASKS_AXI_* env > project .tasks.toml >
 *   ~/.tasks-axi/config.toml > defaults (markdown, first existing
 *   backlog.md/data/backlog.md, otherwise backlog.md).
